stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> OBSERVE
  OBSERVE --> RANK: tickResult arrives
  RANK --> ACT: alert >= amber band 0.35
  RANK --> OBSERVE: worst edge stays green
  ACT --> MONITOR: directive patch applied<br/>(capacity / demand multipliers)
  ACT --> OBSERVE: no defensible edge to touch
  MONITOR --> OBSERVE: utilisation decayed under 1.0
  MONITOR --> RANK: sustained saturation<br/>escalate or revert

  note right of MONITOR
    multipliers compose multiplicatively,
    clamped to 0.05 .. 2.5 per edge,
    so mass conservation survives any patch
  end note

  note left of RANK
    sort key: riskScore desc,
    tie-break: edgeId asc - deterministic
  end note
